# ASHVALE public repository: what stays on this machine (2026-10-06: "leave out the key file and any logs and
# any other private data. Or secure data.")

# keys, wallets, sign-ins, private data
*.key
.key
.env*
*.pem
*secret*
*_state.json
*.token
